al too so you know  prioritization preferences commitments  choices habits all of these things we we  want them to be structured by Prudence  which we're not born with we have to  develop over time you probably don't  have enough of it I don't have enough of  it but we can certainly improve it over  time and we can  you know kind of take heart hopefully  in the fact that everybody else is  struggling with the same thing even if  they don't know it even if they present  themselves as not struggling with it  everybody is so you are I am and you  know just try to do it a little bit  better
 

